cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Robust multi-objective low-Reynolds-number airfoil design"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline and config-driven tool for robust, multi-objective
  airfoil optimization at low Reynolds number, using AeroSandbox and the
  differentiable NeuralFoil surrogate, with manufacturing-tolerance robustness
  and independent XFoil validation.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Madhav
    given-names: Neel
    email: neelmadhavsingharoy@gmail.com
keywords:
  - airfoil optimization
  - low Reynolds number
  - robust optimization
  - multi-objective optimization
  - NeuralFoil
  - AeroSandbox
  - XFoil
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-24"
references:
  - type: software
    title: AeroSandbox
    authors:
      - family-names: Sharpe
        given-names: Peter
    notes: Differentiable optimization + NeuralFoil surrogate.
  - type: software
    title: XFoil
    authors:
